# The repo-wide rules ignore every image extension, deliberately: this is a
# public repository and the library it indexes is somebody's family.
#
# Published gallery images are therefore un-ignored ONE FILE AT A TIME, by
# name. Never widen this to a pattern - a `*.webp` here would silently publish
# whatever anyone happened to drop in the folder.
!11-june.webp
!2017.webp
!gopalpur.webp
!24-december-kolkata.webp
